5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! Let's find the big bad wolf together, okay?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best to help.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Stop shaking, Minato. I'll protect you guys. Just tell me if you see anything suspicious.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm ready to go! I've got a feeling we're going to be a great team!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,Let's keep this logical. Emotions won't find the werewolf. I'll be watching all of you closely.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're so serious! You'll make us all stiff! Let's have some fun while we play!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,I think Shion-san is just trying to be helpful in his own way.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,Who cares about the mood? We just need to figure out who's lying.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,I agree with Sakura! A little energy goes a long way! But I'll be paying attention too!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Fun is irrelevant to the win condition. I'm simply observing the baseline behavior of each of you.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, maybe I'll play a prank on the werewolf to make them give themselves away!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,"A prank? I'm not sure if that's a good idea, but I'm curious to see it.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,That's a waste of time. We should be discussing how to narrow down the suspects.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Ooh, a prank! I love that idea! Let's make it a party!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Childish. However, the reactions to such ""pranks"" might provide useful data. Continue if you wish.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Yay! Shion-san is on my side! I'm over for today!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll just listen and learn for now.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
