34,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning everyone! Did anyone have any spooky dreams?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I slept well, thank you. I wonder if the Seer found something?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, don't be so obvious. If the Seer knows something, they'll tell us when it's the right time.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mio,,Good morning! Actually... I have some really big news! I found the werewolf!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shion,,"That was fast. @Mio, are you claiming to be the Seer?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa! Mio-chan is the Seer? That's so cool! Who is it, who is it?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minato,,"Really? I didn't expect it to be so quick. Who did you find, Mio-san?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"Hold on. @Mio, you're just shouting it out? That's a reckless way to play. You're making yourself a target.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mio,,I can't keep it a secret! It's Takumi! Takumi is the werewolf!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A direct accusation. Either Mio is the Seer, or she's the werewolf trying to frame Takumi.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, are you really the wolf? That's so scary! But also kind of exciting!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minato,,@Takumi-san... is it true? You said you'd protect us.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, you're lying through your teeth! I'm a villager! You're just trying to get rid of me because I'm the strongest here!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm not lying! I saw it with my own eyes—well, my divine eyes! You're definitely the wolf!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your reaction is quite emotional. @Mio, your confidence is high. It's a classic clash.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I think I believe Mio-chan! She's too energetic to be lying! Let's go with Takumi!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I... I don't want to believe it, but if Mio-san is the Seer, we have to trust her.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"You idiots! You're just falling for her act! If you kill me, you're killing a human!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mio,,See? He's getting all grumpy because he's caught! Let's vote him out!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shion,,The probability of Mio being the Seer is higher given the timing. I'll follow the logic.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
